msgctxt "quest/014/GaiUse302_01443:TEXT_GAIUSE302_01443_TREMBLEMAN01443_000_130:1"
msgid "It's not f-fair. You should be here to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>soothe</ui-edge-color></ui-color> me. Why didn't you listen to me?"
msgstr "Несправедливо... Ты должен быть здесь и <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>успокаивать</ui-edge-color></ui-color> меня. Почему ты меня не послушал?"

#. ja: ヒッ……！？<br>あ……ああ……ごめんなさい……ごめんなさい……！
#. de: Huch?! Nein, nein ... Bitte nicht! Tu mir nichts! So finde ich niemals <i>Ruhe</i>!
#. fr: ... Qu'est-ce que vous faites<nbsp>? L-laissez-moi tranquille... (snif)
#. speaker: TREMBLEMAN01443
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
